# PC card team-farm (BENCH-194, TMODE-41..44): arm bb (A/A, master again under another name), all 46 teams x 6 fresh seeds from 9400, against master (the aa build). Template: tfprep writes work/team-farm-bb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
6
--seed-base
9400
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
team-census46.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
